@host = http://localhost:5080

### KPI summary
GET {{host}}/api/leads/summary

### List (search / status / source / paging)
GET {{host}}/api/leads?status=Qualified&page=1&pageSize=20

### One lead
GET {{host}}/api/leads/14

### Create lead
POST {{host}}/api/leads
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Test",
  "lastName": "Lead",
  "email": "test.lead@mail.example",
  "phone": "555-999-1234",
  "company": "Test Co",
  "jobTitle": "Buyer",
  "source": "website",
  "status": "New",
  "score": 20,
  "estimatedValue": 5000
}

### Update lead
PUT {{host}}/api/leads/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Olivia",
  "lastName": "Bennett",
  "email": "olivia.bennett@tidewaterfreight.example",
  "phone": "555-301-2001",
  "company": "Tidewater Freight",
  "jobTitle": "Operations Manager",
  "source": "website",
  "status": "Contacted",
  "score": 45,
  "estimatedValue": 12000
}
